  data: {
    LLM: "1. **Dealing**: Cards dealt to all players.\n2. **Bidding/Contract**: Players may bid for the right to name trumps or play a special contract.\n3. **Trump Selection**: The declarer chooses the trump suit (or plays a no-trump/solo contract).\n4. **Trick Play**: Player to dealer's left leads. Must follow suit if possible. If void, may play any card (trump or discard).\n5. **Winning Tricks**: Highest trump wins, or highest card of led suit. Winner leads to next trick.",
    Player: "1. **Dealing**: Cards dealt to all players.\n2. **Bidding/Contract**: Players may bid for the right to name trumps or play a special contract.\n3. **Trump Selection**: The declarer chooses the trump suit (or plays a no-trump/solo contract).\n4. **Trick Play**: Player to dealer's left leads. Must follow suit if possible. If void, may play any card (trump or discard).\n5. **Winning Tricks**: Highest trump wins, or highest card of led suit. Winner leads to next trick.",
